# --- environments & caches
# One virtual environment at the repository root, shared by phase1/ and phase2/.
# It may be a symlink to a venv outside iCloud (iCloud evicts venv files).
.venv
.venv.*/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
*.log

# --- data
# Raw dataset (~43 MB) is re-downloadable from Kaggle; place it in phase1/data/raw/.
# Phase 2 reads the same file through aerocast.config.RAW_CSV (no second copy).
phase1/data/raw/*.csv
# Phase 2 derived tensors / sequence caches (rebuilt from the raw CSV).
phase2/data/cache/

# --- results
# phase1/results/ IS committed, including results/predictions.csv.gz (~6 MB): it
# is the audit trail for every reported number and lets notebook 04 run without
# re-training. Regenerate everything with `python scripts/run_phase1.py` from phase1/.

# --- model weights
# Trained PyTorch checkpoints are reproducible from the seeded pipeline.
*.pt
*.pth

# --- report
# Earlier 22-page version of the Phase 1 report (kept locally as a viva supplement;
# compiles on its own: cd phase1/report/long_version && tectonic -X compile main.tex).
phase1/report/long_version/
README_SLIDES_7_AND_8_CONCEPTS.md
README_SLIDES_7_AND_8_QUESTIONS.md